{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Monster Musk is a ",["l","打造","crafted item"]," used to encounter more ",["l","怪物","monsters"],". The recipe is earned after completing the ",["l","法师","Wizard"],"'s Special Order ",["l","任务","\"Prismatic Jelly\""],". It can also be obtained by trading a ",["l","战斗季刊","Combat Quarterly"]," with the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"],"."]],["p",["Monster Musk has a duration of 10 minutes. If any player has the ",["l","效果","Monster Musk buff"],", the number of enemies on a given floor of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," or ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," when entering the floor is doubled. It doesn't have an effect in areas resetting at the end of the day like the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],", the ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"]," or the ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"],". However, it will still affect the number of off map spawns."]],["p",["It is a special-effect buff, meaning that using Monster Musk will not remove any buffs from consumed drinks or food, or vice-versa."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Monster Musk is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Monster Musk can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the dyeable ",["l","裁缝","Dark Highlight Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a purple dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],". It can also be used as a purple dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Monster Musk is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","打造","Crafting"]," • ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]]],["Ingredients",[["i","(O)766","Slime ×30"],["i","(O)767","Bat Wing ×30"]]],["Sell Price",["50g"]]]}